  "statement_html": "\tOn considère les points \\(A\\), \\(B\\) et \\(C\\) d'affixes respectives : <br>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> \\(z_{A} =\\) \\(- 3 i - 1\\) &nbsp;;&nbsp;\t\\(z_{B} =\\) \\(2 - i\\) &nbsp;;&nbsp;\t\\(z_{C} =\\) \\(4\\) - \\(3\\) \\(\\sqrt{3}\\) + i (- \\(4\\) - \\(2\\) \\(\\sqrt{3}\\))</div>\t\t<ul>\t<li>\tOn cherche à calculer l'angle \\((\\overrightarrow{BA};\\overrightarrow{BC})\\). Pour trouver une mesure de cet angle, il faut chercher un argument d'un quotient. Lequel ?<br>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{A}}{z_{B} - z_{A}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{B} - z_{A}}{z_{C} - z_{A}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{B}}{z_{A} - z_{B}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{A}}{z_{A} - z_{B}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"5\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{A} - z_{B}}{z_{C} - z_{B}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"6\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{B} - z_{C}}{z_{A} - z_{C}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"7\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{A} - z_{C}}{z_{B} - z_{C}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"8\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{B} - z_{C}}{z_{C} - z_{A}}\\)</label></div>\t</li></ul>\t",
